# Google Maps API Configuration
# Get your free API key from: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 
# Steps to obtain your API key:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Create a new project or select an existing one
# 3. Enable these APIs:
#    - Maps JavaScript API
#    - Places API
#    - Geocoding API
# 4. Create an API key (Restricted to Web)
# 5. Add your domain to allowed referrers
# 6. Copy the API key and paste it below

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_actual_api_key_here

# Note: This file is for reference only.
# Create a .env file in the project root with your actual API key.
# NEVER commit .env to version control!
